# Container geometry

Full contract: `docs/architecture/container_geometry.md`.

## Must

- Use `luggage_description.container_geometry` as the authority for container
  usable-space descriptor/hash, containment, area, and volume.
- Treat AABBs as indexing or broad-phase structures only. Clip to the hull
  before reporting usable, free, reachable, blocked, covered, or placeable
  space.
- Check complete oriented payload boxes or swept boxes. Center-point checks
  alone are invalid.
- Run hull filtering before ranking, retention, `top_n`, or first-feasible
  selection.
- Fail closed on missing, invalid, unsupported, or mismatched geometry. Do not
  silently fall back from seven-face geometry to legacy `inner_size`.
- Keep eval/Gazebo truth out of online geometry and usable-space denominators.
